        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>나트륨</choice_text>
          <commentary>나트륨은 제3류 위험물이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>알킬리튬</choice_text>
          <commentary>알킬리튬은 제3류 위험물이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>아염소산염류</choice_text>
          <commentary>아염소산염류는 제1류 위험물이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
